y.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-canvas-16-x-20-x-0-75-photo-canvas-1.jpg?v=1500068427"},{"product_id":"16-square-microfleece-photo-pillow","title":"16\" Square MicroFleece Photo Pillow","description":"The 16\" Micro-Fleece Photo Pillow is the perfect size for those looking to not give up too much couch space, however. Surround your seating companion with luxurious polar fleece material. Each pillow contains a hypoallergenic 100% polyester pillow insert. Sham and insert are both included in the price of each sized pillow.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 16\" x 16\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial\u003c\/strong\u003e: Luxurious micro-fleece material\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 5-8 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Super soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDye Sublimation Printed - Image never Fades\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMachine Washable cover and insert\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46343449667,"sku":"16MFPLW","price":39.94,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/microfleece-pillows-16-square-microfleece-photo-pillow-1.jpg?v=1500068392"},{"product_id":"20-square-microfleece-photo-pillow","title":"20\" Square MicroFleece Photo Pillow","description":"Preserve your precious memories in a luxurious micro-fleece pillow you can sit about the couch with. Our stain resistant micro-fleece comes in several different colors and is of the highest quality; Each pillow contains a hypoallerge